{"title":"两部门批准发布强制医疗所建设标准，自2024年9月1日起施行","date":"2024-06-21","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.5pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">两部门批准发布强制医疗所建设标准，自<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日起施行</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"right\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:33.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;letter-spacing:\r\n.75pt\">近日，住房城乡建设部、国家发展改革委发布通知提出，由公安部组织编制的《强制医疗所建设标准》已经有关部门会审，现批准发布，编号为建标<span lang=\"EN-US\">200-2024</span>，自<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日起施行。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"right\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nArial;letter-spacing:.75pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size: 15pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: bl